e other way (the left face comes to the front).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/41.svg","y","Turn the whole cube like a U (the right face comes to the front).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/40.svg","x'","Turn the whole cube like an R' (the front goes down).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/39.svg","x","Turn the whole cube like an R (the front goes up).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/38.svg","b'","The two back layers together: a quarter turn counterclockwise, like B'.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/37.svg","b","The two back layers together (the outer one and the middle one): a quarter turn like B. Also written Bw.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/36.svg","f'","The two front layers together: a quarter turn counterclockwise, like F'.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/35.svg","f","The two front layers together: a quarter turn clockwise.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/34.svg","d'","The two bottom layers together: a quarter turn counterclockwise, like D'.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/33.svg","d","The two bottom layers together (the outer one and the middle one): a quarter turn like D. Also written Dw.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/32.svg","u'","The two top layers together: a quarter turn counterclockwise, like U'.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/31.svg","u","The two top layers together (the outer one and the middle one): a quarter turn like U. Also written Uw.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/30.svg","l'","The two left layers together: a quarter turn counterclockwise, like L'.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/29.svg","l","The two left layers together (the outer one and the middle one): a quarter turn like L. Also written Lw.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/28.svg","r'","The two right layers together: a quarter turn counterclockwise, like R'.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/27.svg","r","The two right layers together (the outer one and the middle one): a quarter turn like R. Also written Rw.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/26.svg","S'","Middle layer, between F and B: a quarter turn in the direction of F' (the top goes to the left).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/25.svg","S","Middle layer, between F and B: a quarter turn in the direction of F (the top goes to the right).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/24.svg","E'","Middle layer, between U and D: a quarter turn in the direction of U (the front goes to the left).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/23.svg","E","Middle layer, between U and D: a quarter turn in the direction of D (the front goes to the right).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/22.svg","M'","Middle layer, between L and R: a quarter turn in the direction of R (the front goes up).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/20.svg","M","Middle layer, between L and R: a quarter turn in the direction of L (the front goes down).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/19.svg","B'","Back face: a quarter turn counterclockwise.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/17.svg","B","Back face: a quarter turn clockwise (looking at the back face, from behind the cube).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/16.svg","F'","Front face: a quarter turn counterclockwise.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/14.svg","F","Front face: a quarter turn clockwise.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/13.svg","D'","Bottom face: a quarter turn counterclockwise.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/11.svg","D","Bottom face: a quarter turn clockwise (looking from below).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/10.svg","U'","Top face: a quarter turn counterclockwise.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/8.svg","U","Top face: a quarter turn clockwise (looking from above).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/7.svg","L'","Left face: a quarter turn counterclockwise.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/5.svg","L","Left face: a quarter turn clockwise (looking at the left face).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/4.svg","R'","Right face: a quarter turn counterclockwise.","/imagens/notacao/3x3/2.svg","R","Right face: a quarter turn clockwise (as if you were looking at the right face).","/imagens/notacao/3x3/1.svg",{"_192":230,"_194":231,"_196":232,"_15":233},{"_192":208,"_194":209,"_196":197,"_15":210},{"_192":202,"_194":203,"_196":197,"_15":204},{"_192":193,"_194":195,"_196":197,"_15":198},"id","zz","nome","ZZ","nivel","intermediario",[199,200,201],"ZZLL","2GLL","ZBLL","roux","Roux",[205,206,207],"SBLS","CMLL","EO 4a